  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "ObjParser is a specialized service responsible for ingesting raw string content from Wavefront .obj files. It parses geometric primitives like vertices, UVs, and normals, and then consolidates this raw data into a WebGL-ready MeshData structure. The core logic merges geometrically identical elements based on the combination of position, UV, and normal indices to ensure efficient buffer usage for rendering systems."
  },
